# PWA Standards (Next.js & Tailwind)

## Framework & Styling
- Use Next.js 15+ App Router patterns.
- Use Tailwind CSS 4 for all styling.
- **NEVER** use raw hex colors in components; use CSS variables/tokens.

## Accessibility (A11y)
- **MANDATORY**: Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Ensure all interactive elements have visible focus rings.
- Use semantic HTML elements (`button`, `a`, `nav`, etc.).
- Maintain high color contrast for readability.

## Local-First & Sync
- Use `dexie` for local IndexedDB persistence.
- Ensure offline-first functionality with Service Workers.
- Follow the sync protocol defined in `docs/guides/pwa-sync.md`.
